        "text": "For a magical end to your baby's first birthday party, try this unique favor idea: \"I love giving out mini snow globes as Winter Onederland party favors,\" says Kruse. If that's not feasible, \"you can also put homemade hot cocoa mix in Mason jars with cute, winter-themed tags.\"",
